{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "Qwen-Image and Qwen-Image-Edit (20B) as stable-diffusion.cpp's docs/qwen_image.md and docs/qwen_image_edit.md run them: the diffusion model plus the Qwen-Image VAE and the Qwen2.5-VL 7B text encoder, at CFG 2.5 with flow shift 3. Files from Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI. Qwen-Image-Edit 2511 also needs --model-args qwen_image_zero_cond_t=true (Extra arguments).",
  "docs": "https://github.com/leejet/stable-diffusion.cpp/blob/f89d9b13d730eabeede7314ce49dacd18d3c90c2/docs/qwen_image.md",
  "types": {"qwen-image": "Qwen-Image / Qwen-Image-Edit"},
